{
  "name": "@huo15/huo15-openclaw-enhance",
  "version": "6.1.9",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "description": "火一五·克劳德·龙虾增强插件 v6.1.9 — 修第二天失忆问题：(A) session-bridge 窗口 3x 扩容（tailMessages 8→20、maxChars 4000→12000、priorMaxAgeHours 48→72），跨夜会话上下文从 4KB → 12KB；(B) native-memory-surfacer 松绑（maxFiles 5→12、threshold 0.15→0.05、新增 cwdRelevanceBoost + ageRecencyBoost），让 user/reference 类 .md 也能被 surface（用户实测 37 个 .md 之前只 surface 5 个，72% 没注入）。继承 v6.1.8 bot-share 翻转、v6.1.7 capability 验证、v6.1.6 quota-aware、v6.1.5 cc-bridge prompt、v6.1.4 智能路由。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.ts",
  "openclaw": {
    "extensions": [
      "./index.ts"
    ],
    "build": {
      "openclawVersion": "2026.4.29"
    },
    "compat": {
      "pluginApi": ">=2026.4.24"
    }
  },
  "bin": {
    "openclaw-enhance-setup": "./scripts/setup.sh"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "release": "bash scripts/release.sh",
    "prepublishOnly": "npm run typecheck",
    "postinstall": "node scripts/postinstall.cjs"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "openclaw",
    "plugin",
    "enhance",
    "memory",
    "safety",
    "agent"
  ],
  "author": "jobzhao15",
  "license": "MIT",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "openclaw": "^2026.4.24"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@sinclair/typebox": "^0.34.49",
    "better-sqlite3": "^11.0.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/better-sqlite3": "^7.6.0",
    "typescript": "^5.5.0"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.ts",
    "openclaw.plugin.json",
    "src/**/*",
    "templates/**/*",
    "scripts/**/*"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://cnb.cool/huo15/ai/huo15-openclaw-enhance"
  }
}
